  "note": "Models the current museum architecture after the2010restoration, not an operating airport. Placement and rear control-tower projection follow the mapped footprint; all vertical dimensions are explicit estimates from exterior proportions because no reliable surveyed height was found. White stucco, terracotta hips, actual recessed arch glazing and iron balcony rhythm remain in far. A narrow authored stair/landing projection is registered separately. Sourcephotos1and5show the building;2is an interior workbench,3an interior room and4garden sculpture, all rejected. Temporary exhibition banners, lettering, mural artwork, sculpture garden and unrelated northern annex653783466are omitted. No reference imagery, logos or lettering are shipped; no terrain height is baked. Geographic rotation is baked once from mapped controls. Cityscape: not tested. Full 3D world: not tested.",
